---@description "낚시 보상과 쿠키 소비를 원자적으로 저장하고 거래별 중복 방지"
@Logic
script FishingRewardStorage extends Logic
	property string STORAGE_KEY = "fishingRewards"
	property string RECEIPT_PREFIX = "fishingTxn_"
	property string RECEIPT_TAG = "fishing_transaction"
	property string INITIALIZATION_MEMORY = "FishingRewardInitialization"
	property string INITIALIZATION_PREFIX = "Init_"
	property string KIND_REWARD = "reward"
	property string KIND_COOKIE = "cookie"
	property integer CONFLICT_CODE = 2000000
	property integer MAX_ATTEMPTS = 6
	property any initializationMemory = nil

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method any Read(any storage)
		local code, raw = storage:GetAndWait(self.STORAGE_KEY)
		if _DataStorageErrorUtil:IsNotFound(code) or (code == 0 and raw == nil) then return {missing = true} end
		if code ~= 0 then return nil end
		local ok, plain = pcall(function() return _HttpService:JSONDecode(raw) end)
		local tData = FishingRewardData()
		if not ok or not tData:FromPlainTable(plain) then
			log_error("[FishingReward] 손상 데이터 보존 user=" .. storage.UserId)
			return nil
		end
		return {tData = tData, raw = raw}
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method any LoadOrCreate(any storage)
		-- 최초 생성만 인스턴스 간 잠금, 이후 거래는 CAS 사용
		local read = self:Read(storage)
		if read == nil or read.missing ~= true then return read end
		if self.initializationMemory == nil then
			local code, memory = _WorldInstanceService:GetSharedMemory(self.INITIALIZATION_MEMORY)
			if code ~= SharedMemoryResultCode.OK then return nil end
			self.initializationMemory = memory
		end
		local variable = self.INITIALIZATION_PREFIX .. storage.UserId
		if string.len(variable) > 100 or string.match(variable, "^[%w_%-]+$") == nil then return nil end
		local claim = self.initializationMemory:CreateVariableAndWait(variable, _UtilLogic:NewGuid())
		if claim.Code ~= SharedMemoryResultCode.OK then
			local latest = self:Read(storage)
			return latest ~= nil and latest.missing ~= true and latest or nil
		end
		local ok, result = pcall(function()
			local latest = self:Read(storage)
			if latest == nil or latest.missing ~= true then return latest end
			local tData = FishingRewardData()
			storage:SetAndWait(self.STORAGE_KEY, _HttpService:JSONEncode(tData:ToPlainTable()))
			return self:Read(storage)
		end)
		self.initializationMemory:ReleaseVariableAndWait(variable)
		if not ok or result == nil or result.missing == true then return nil end
		return result
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method any ReadReceipt(any storage, string id)
		local code, raw = storage:GetAndWait(self.RECEIPT_PREFIX .. id)
		if _DataStorageErrorUtil:IsNotFound(code) or (code == 0 and raw == nil) then return false end
		if code ~= 0 then return nil end
		local ok, row = pcall(function() return _HttpService:JSONDecode(raw) end)
		if not ok or type(row) ~= "table" or row.id ~= id or type(row.revision) ~= "number" then return nil end
		return row
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method boolean Finalize(any storage, any read)
		-- 수량과 함께 저장된 복구 표식은 영수증 확인 후에만 제거
		local pending = read.tData.pending
		if pending == nil then return true end
		local receipt = self:ReadReceipt(storage, pending.id)
		if receipt == nil then return false end
		if receipt == false then
			local keyInfo = DataStorageKeyInfo()
			keyInfo.Key = self.RECEIPT_PREFIX .. pending.id
			keyInfo.Tag = self.RECEIPT_TAG
			storage:SetByInfoAndWait(keyInfo, _HttpService:JSONEncode(pending))
			receipt = self:ReadReceipt(storage, pending.id)
		end
		if receipt == nil or receipt == false or receipt.revision ~= pending.revision
			or receipt.kind ~= pending.kind or receipt.target ~= pending.target or receipt.score ~= pending.score
			or receipt.itemId ~= pending.itemId or receipt.count ~= pending.count then return false end
		local tNext = FishingRewardData()
		if not tNext:FromPlainTable(read.tData:ToPlainTable()) then return false end
		tNext.pending = nil
		local code, storedRaw = storage:UpdateAndWait(self.STORAGE_KEY, read.raw, _HttpService:JSONEncode(tNext:ToPlainTable()))
		return code == 0 or code == self.CONFLICT_CODE
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method any Apply(string userId, string id, string kind, integer score, string target)
		return self:ApplyWithStorage(_DataStorageService:GetUserDataStorage(userId), id, kind, score, target)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method any ApplyWithStorage(any storage, string id, string kind, integer score, string target)
		-- 지급량, 초회 여부, 쿠키 차감과 친밀도 가산을 하나의 CAS로 확정
		if storage == nil or string.len(id) > 70 or string.match(id, "^[%w_%-]+$") == nil
			or (kind ~= self.KIND_REWARD and kind ~= self.KIND_COOKIE) then return nil end
		for attempt = 1, self.MAX_ATTEMPTS do
			local read = self:LoadOrCreate(storage)
			if read == nil then return nil end
			local tData = read.tData
			local receipt = tData.pending ~= nil and tData.pending.id == id and tData.pending or self:ReadReceipt(storage, id)
			if receipt == nil then return nil end
			if receipt ~= false then
				if receipt.kind ~= kind or receipt.score ~= score or receipt.target ~= target then return nil end
				if receipt.revision > tData.revision then continue end
				self:Finalize(storage, read)
				return {tData = tData, receipt = receipt}
			end
			if tData.pending ~= nil then
				if not self:Finalize(storage, read) then return nil end
				continue
			end
			local tNext = FishingRewardData()
			if not tNext:FromPlainTable(tData:ToPlainTable()) then return nil end
			local row = {id = id, kind = kind, target = target, score = score,
				revision = tData.revision + 1, itemId = "", count = 0}
			if kind == self.KIND_REWARD then
				if score < 0 then return nil end
				if tNext.pendingResult ~= nil and (tNext.pendingResult.id ~= id or tNext.pendingResult.score ~= score) then return nil end
				tNext.pendingResult = nil
				local rank = _MiniGameFishingRule:RankForScore(score)
				if rank == 1 and not tNext.badgeGranted then
					tNext.badgeGranted = true
					row.itemId = _MiniGameFishingRule.BADGE_ID
					row.count = 1
				else
					row.itemId = _MiniGameFishingRule.COOKIE_ID
					row.count = _MiniGameFishingRule:CookiesForRank(rank)
					tNext.cookies = tNext.cookies + row.count
				end
			else
				if target == "" or tNext.cookies < 1 then return nil end
				tNext.cookies = tNext.cookies - 1
				tNext.intimacyByCharacter[target] = (tNext.intimacyByCharacter[target] or 0) + 5
				row.itemId = _MiniGameFishingRule.COOKIE_ID
				row.count = -1
			end
			tNext.revision = row.revision
			tNext.pending = row
			local raw = _HttpService:JSONEncode(tNext:ToPlainTable())
			if string.len(raw) > 4000 then return nil end
			local code, storedRaw = storage:UpdateAndWait(self.STORAGE_KEY, read.raw, raw)
			if code == 0 then
				self:Finalize(storage, {tData = tNext, raw = raw})
				log("[FishingReward] 저장 완료 kind=" .. kind .. " id=" .. id .. " count=" .. tostring(row.count))
				return {tData = tNext, receipt = row}
			end
			if code ~= self.CONFLICT_CODE and code ~= _DataStorageErrorUtil.TimedOut then return nil end
		end
		return nil
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method boolean QueueResult(string userId, string id, integer score)
		-- 종료 점수를 지급 전에 영속 보관하여 재접속 시 미완료 정산 복구
		local storage = _DataStorageService:GetUserDataStorage(userId)
		for attempt = 1, self.MAX_ATTEMPTS do
			local read = self:LoadOrCreate(storage)
			if read == nil then return false end
			local receipt = read.tData.pending ~= nil and read.tData.pending.id == id
				and read.tData.pending or self:ReadReceipt(storage, id)
			if receipt == nil then return false end
			if receipt ~= false then return receipt.kind == self.KIND_REWARD and receipt.score == score end
			local row = read.tData.pendingResult
			if row ~= nil then return row.id == id and row.score == score end
			read.tData.pendingResult = {id = id, score = score}
			local raw = _HttpService:JSONEncode(read.tData:ToPlainTable())
			if string.len(raw) > 4000 then return false end
			local code, storedRaw = storage:UpdateAndWait(self.STORAGE_KEY, read.raw, raw)
			if code == 0 then return true end
			if code ~= self.CONFLICT_CODE and code ~= _DataStorageErrorUtil.TimedOut then return false end
		end
		return false
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void OnEndPlay()
		if self.initializationMemory ~= nil then
			_WorldInstanceService:ReleaseSharedMemoryAndWait(self.INITIALIZATION_MEMORY)
			self.initializationMemory = nil
		end
	end
end
